    "selection_rationale": [
      "Bergamot is retained over grapefruit, mandarin, and lime because it is a documented La Nuit identity counterforce to cardamom.",
      "Iso E supplies molecular-skin lateral air while literal Virginia cedar prevents abstract-wood erasure; Timberol and Norlimbanol were rejected as too rigid.",
      "Regular Hedione maps radiance only; it is not claimed equivalent to Hedione HC and remains below the crowding ceiling.",
      "EB remains the one current musk for structural continuity; no extra clean musk is added."
    ],
    "drift_risk": "More dihydromyrcenol, ozonic materials, or another clean musk would flatten the cardamom-lavender tension into generic freshness."
  },
